# Mobile sync

- After regenerating handoff files on Local Mac, run `~/.local/bin/sync-aidataengineer-handoff.sh`.
- Copy only `HANDOFF.md` and `CHANGELOG_SESSION.md` to
  `~/Library/Mobile Documents/com~apple~CloudDocs/AI-Projects/AIDataEngineer/`.
- Never copy the repository, `.git`, secrets, or source.
- Verify destination SHA256 and `cmp`. Treat verification failure as a blocker.
- Sync immediately on blocker, review, or failure. Cloud agents cannot write iCloud.
